            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Keep It Available: </strong>Store unopened bottles in a clean, cool, dry area away from sunlight, heat,<br/>chemicals, fuels, strong odors, pests, and contamination.</p><p><strong>Inspect Before Opening: </strong>Confirm that the bottle, cap, and tamper-evident seal are intact.</p><p><strong>Drink Normally: </strong>Consume according to personal preference, activity, environment, diet, and professional advice. No universal number of bottles is recommended.</p><p><strong>After Opening: </strong>Refrigerate and consume promptly. Do not share or repeatedly refill a single-use bottle.</p><p>No charging, activation, waiting period, geometric arrangement, or special placement is required.</p>",
            "page": ""
