          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Directions for Use",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<ul><li>Inspect the bottle and tamper-evident seal before opening.</li><li>Do not consume if the seal is broken, the bottle leaks, or the water has an unusual appearance, odor, or taste.</li><li>Open with clean hands and drink according to ordinary hydration needs.</li><li>Refrigerate after opening and consume promptly. Do not share an opened bottle.</li><li>Do not refill or repeatedly reuse a bottle designed for single use.</li><li>Store unopened bottles in a clean, cool, dry area away from sunlight, chemicals, fuels, strong odors, pests, and excessive heat.</li><li>Do not microwave, boil, or heat water in the original plastic bottle. Transfer it to a suitable heat-safe container if warming is desired.</li><li>Follow the printed lot and best-by information and recycle the empty bottle and cap where accepted.</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
