          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Safety Information and Limitations",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<ul><li>Consume only from bottles with an intact tamper-evident seal.</li><li>Do not consume from a leaking, swollen, punctured, opened, damaged, or abnormal bottle.</li><li>Store away from sunlight, excessive heat, chemicals, gasoline, pesticides, cleaning products, and strong odors.</li><li>Do not leave cases in a hot vehicle for extended periods.</li><li>Do not microwave, boil, or heat water in the original plastic bottle.</li><li>Refrigerate after opening, consume promptly, and do not repeatedly refill a single-use bottle.</li><li>Keep caps and plastic packaging away from infants and young children.</li><li>Do not use for wound care, contact-lens care, nasal rinsing, injection, inhalation equipment, or another medical use.</li><li>Do not use as a substitute for prescribed oral rehydration products or medical treatment.</li><li>Retain the bottle, lot code, case, and purchase information when reporting contamination, illness, damage, or a quality concern.</li></ul>",
